msgid "Linux host with Docker and docker compose available"
msgstr "具备 Docker 与 docker compose 的 Linux 主机"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:13
msgid "``wg`` binary available in ``$PATH`` (used for key generation)"
msgstr "``wg`` 可执行程序在 ``$PATH`` 中（用于生成密钥）"

