#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:27
msgid "``server_config.yml``: Authoritative server-side configuration (auto-copied from packaged template on first use)"
msgstr "``server_config.yml``：权威的服务端配置（首次使用会从包内模板自动拷贝）"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:28
msgid "``server_wg0.conf``: Rendered WireGuard server config"
msgstr "``server_wg0.conf``：渲染后的 WireGuard 服务端配置"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:29
msgid "``server_compose.yml``: Rendered docker compose for the server"
msgstr "``server_compose.yml``：渲染后的服务端 docker compose"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:30
msgid "``client_wg0.conf``: Rendered WireGuard client config"
msgstr "``client_wg0.conf``：渲染后的 WireGuard 客户端配置"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:31
msgid "``client_compose.yml``: Rendered docker compose for the client"
msgstr "``client_compose.yml``：渲染后的客户端 docker compose"

