#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:108
msgid "`server_config.yml` Schema"
msgstr "`server_config.yml` 结构"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:110
msgid "Top-level keys:"
msgstr "顶层键："

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:112
msgid "``server``: - ``nic`` (str): Outbound interface for MASQUERADE rules (default ``eth0``) - ``server_ip`` (str): Public IP or DNS name for server endpoint - ``subnet`` (str): Server-side IPv4 subnet in CIDR notation (e.g., ``10.9.0.0/24``) - ``listen_port`` (int): UDP port for the server"
msgstr "``server``：- ``nic``（字符串）：用于 MASQUERADE 的出站网卡（默认 ``eth0``）- ``server_ip``（字符串）：服务端公网 IP 或域名 - ``subnet``（字符串）：服务端 IPv4 子网 CIDR（如 ``10.9.0.0/24``）- ``listen_port``（整数）：服务端 UDP 监听端口"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:118
msgid "``clients`` (dict[int, client]) — keys are client ids 2..254. Each client has: - ``nic`` (str): Host interface used by client for LAN routes in PostUp/PreDown - ``exclude_defaults`` (bool): Whether to merge default private/link-local ranges into ``excludedips`` - ``allowedips`` (list/str): Values rendered into client ``AllowedIPs`` (default ``[\"0.0.0.0/0\"]``) - ``excludedips`` (list/str): CIDRs or addresses routed outside the tunnel - ``snat`` (bool): Whether server applies SNAT for traffic destined to this client - ``c_to_s_ports`` (list): Per-entry format ``[client_port, server_port, [tsl_method]]`` where ``tsl_method`` is ``tcp`` or ``udp`` (defaults to ``tcp``)"
msgstr "``clients``（字典[int, client]）——键为 2..254 的客户端编号。每个客户端包含：- ``nic``：客户端用于本地 LAN 路由的网卡 - ``exclude_defaults``：是否将默认私有/链路本地网段合并进 ``excludedips`` - ``allowedips``：渲染到客户端 ``AllowedIPs`` 的值（默认 ``[\"0.0.0.0/0\"]``）- ``excludedips``：经由直连的 CIDR 或地址 - ``snat``：服务端是否对发往该客户端的流量做 SNAT - ``c_to_s_ports``：条目格式 ``[client_port, server_port, [tsl_method]]``，``tsl_method`` 为 ``tcp`` 或 ``udp``（默认 ``tcp``）"

