msgstr "示例："

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:159
msgid "Routing Behavior (Client)"
msgstr "路由行为（客户端）"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:161
msgid "The client template sets ``PostUp`` and ``PreDown`` commands to preserve reachability:"
msgstr "客户端模板通过 ``PostUp`` 与 ``PreDown`` 命令保证可达性："

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:163
msgid "Always adds a specific route for the WireGuard subnet via ``wg0``"
msgstr "始终为 WireGuard 子网通过 ``wg0`` 添加特定路由"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:164
msgid "If ``excludedips`` (possibly merged with ``exclude_defaults``) is non-empty, routes those destinations via the client's ``nic`` and default gateway when available"
msgstr "若 ``excludedips``（可能与 ``exclude_defaults`` 合并）非空，则经客户端 ``nic`` 与默认网关路由这些目的网段"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:167
msgid "Port Forwarding and Compose Ports (Server)"
msgstr "端口转发与 Compose 端口（服务端）"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:169
msgid "For each client mapping in ``c_to_s_ports``, two things happen: 1. iptables PREROUTING/ FORWARD rules are emitted to DNAT and ACCEPT traffic destined to ``server_port`` towards the client's ``client_port`` and IP 2. The server compose file exposes a host port mapping ``server_port/server_protocol``"
msgstr "对 ``c_to_s_ports`` 的每条映射，将发生两件事：1）生成 iptables PREROUTING/FORWARD 规则，将到达 ``server_port`` 的流量 DNAT/ACCEPT 到客户端的 ``client_port`` 与 IP；2）服务端 compose 暴露对应的宿主机端口映射 ``server_port/server_protocol``"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:174
msgid "Generated Files and Templates"
msgstr "生成文件与模板"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:176
msgid "Templates (shipped): ``server_wg0.conf.j2``, ``client_wg0.conf.j2``, ``server_compose.yml.j2``, ``client_compose.yml.j2``"
msgstr "内置模板：``server_wg0.conf.j2``、``client_wg0.conf.j2``、``server_compose.yml.j2``、``client_compose.yml.j2``"

#: ../../source/wg_docker/index.rst:177
msgid "Outputs (rendered in user config dir): ``server_wg0.conf``, ``client_wg0.conf``, ``server_compose.yml``, ``client_compose.yml``"
msgstr "渲染产物（用户配置目录）：``server_wg0.conf``、``client_wg0.conf``、``server_compose.yml``、``client_compose.yml``"

